!template.env

# Rokid CXR credentials. NEVER commit these. Only the repository-root
# secrets/ tree is excluded so a legitimate source package named "secrets"
# is not hidden. The .lc filename is itself a Client ID.
/secrets/
*.lc
*_key.txt
客戶端_key.txt

